The head did **not** collapse to the zero function or to zero parameters. It retained non-zero held-out output while remaining decision-inert on these five catalogues. Parameter norm alone would not prove functional distinction, but the directly measured non-zero outputs do; this requested metric set does not distinguish a common offset from more detailed output structure.

