The cleanest contract is a checkpoint scorer over an authenticated, outcome-bearing panel: checkpoints supply only model parameters; the panel supplies the common catalogue, full-buffer physical outcomes, certified fixed-point reference, and 10-second anytime incumbent. This avoids reinterpreting the rate setpoint as demand and prevents the scorer from fabricating timing or physics-call counts. The smoke panel will be explicitly synthetic and non-evidentiary.
